tAuto:e=>`Auto: ${e}`,inputAutoReading:`Auto: reading the LUT…`,inputAutoStandard:`The data cannot tell Standard from sRGB, or from a flat look for a camera log. If the LUT was made for sRGB or a log, choose that input.`,inputAutoLog:`GRKit reads V-Log and F-Log only. A LUT for another camera log, such as S-Log3, LogC, C-Log, or N-Log, imports with wrong colors.`,importUsed:e=>`Input: ${e}`,iconTooWide:`The camera cannot draw this icon. Shorten the text.`,inputStandard:`Standard: a GR JPEG in Standard`,inputSrgb:`sRGB: scene light without a tone curve`,iconHeading:`Icon`,iconBrand:`Brand`,iconFilm:`Film name`,iconNumber:`Number (optional)`,iconBand:`Band at the bottom`,iconNote:`Each text: 1 to 12 English letters, digits, spaces, or symbols.`,iconEdit:`Edit the icon`,importButton:`Import`,importHowTitle:`How it works.`,importHow:`The camera cannot load a LUT, so GRKit tunes the camera's own color settings to come close to it.`,importLimitsTitle:`Limits.`,importLimits:`Close, not exact. Strong looks and bright, saturated colors differ more. Check the preview.`,importing:`Fitting the LUT. This takes a few seconds…`,importError:`The LUT cannot be imported:`,importUnchecked:e=>`A package holds ${e} effects, and ${e} are checked. Uncheck another effect to include this one.`,imported:`Imported`,fitText:{A:`Nearly the same as the LUT.`,B:`The same look with small differences.`,C:`A similar look with visible color differences.`,D:`A different look. The camera cannot make this LUT.`},importWarnings:`Check before you use it:`,importAnother:`Import another`,done:`Done`,close:`Close`,removeEffect:`Remove`,removeOf:e=>`Remove ${e}`,haldSummary:`Importing a Lightroom preset?`,haldNote:`Download the HALD image and open it in the editor. Apply the preset with grain, sharpening, and vignette off. Export it at full size as a 16-bit TIFF or PNG in sRGB, then import the export with Standard input.`,haldDownload:`Download the HALD image`,printFilm:e=>`${e} print`,effectCount:`Effects`,l